      "duration": 6.372
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "方才有个挑柴的，被拦着翻了三遍担子；那顶轿子却径直进去了。你常走这道关口么？",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "c095a0f705da0a95e5157391f3de8afcbdcd3d14497bc8d39fc1962b9573657c",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/c095a0f705da0a95e5157391f3de8afcbdcd3d14497bc8d39fc1962b9573657c.mp3",
      "duration": 7.848
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "城门查得这样紧……你是怎么进来的？",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "a33d834c08d7f738027f62c22722dbc087159fcbcf5840bc994e94e2c44e57f0",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/audition-2026-11-10/prince-28.mp3",
      "duration": 3.888
    },
    {
      "actor": "tea_host",
      "text": "茶刚沏好。客官要坐下歇歇，还是带几个热饼走？",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "cfddd46aea79f1e744adcc41a48d2ababec897ea0ad65c488d316fc12a324248",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/cfddd46aea79f1e744adcc41a48d2ababec897ea0ad65c488d316fc12a324248.mp3",
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "actor": "tea_host",
      "text": "多谢……这一回我记着。",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "aa610b41b8b74fb09fd93fd4969f31f40b95363626b72da9aa54651362eb4132",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/aa610b41b8b74fb09fd93fd4969f31f40b95363626b72da9aa54651362eb4132.mp3",
      "duration": 2.664
    },
    {
      "actor": "gate_guard",
      "text": "站住。把手里的东西放下。你当我没瞧见？",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "e3681e277c3cbe156ac819e44a66944526687414613980b78e6fe7e9979c213a",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/audition-2026-11-10/guard-28.mp3",
      "duration": 5.436
    },
    {
      "actor": "scribe",
      "text": "刻字还是修印？东西拿来看看。",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "f44c6850cc4adf7c04d07652c5e9749b3b5883744641db3fab156c79038f8115",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/f44c6850cc4adf7c04d07652c5e9749b3b5883744641db3fab156c79038f8115.mp3",
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "actor": "gate_merchant",
      "text": "货都在这儿，想买什么？",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "9f800daab6d8743d8eb23b1bbc6830d34975bcc98190b916d2b204b3ea6e5f9d",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/9f800daab6d8743d8eb23b1bbc6830d34975bcc98190b916d2b204b3ea6e5f9d.mp3",
      "duration": 2.268
    },
    {
      "actor": "bookseller",
      "text": "手若是干的，书就翻得。想看哪一种？",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "281f9baf56a4074bdd83fa24a24e80979ea67f505e6e11032101d5e63b54dce1",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/281f9baf56a4074bdd83fa24a24e80979ea67f505e6e11032101d5e63b54dce1.mp3",
      "duration": 7.056
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "劳你照看，缓过些来了。这份情，我记下了。",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "77b2d6526cf3ec22040bf9ed6b307b0bd7cb531560df3ed97ecb694a0b07c475",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/77b2d6526cf3ec22040bf9ed6b307b0bd7cb531560df3ed97ecb694a0b07c475.mp3",
      "duration": 5.148
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "袖中之物，也要劳你代管么？",
      "sources": [
        "src/voice-lines.js#VOICE_TRIAL"
      ],
      "hash": "1ffa63f52d4c4cc6279a74965d2708c7908ff5f4fe3c93e4b25907624ae10e6d",
      "status": "reused",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/1ffa63f52d4c4cc6279a74965d2708c7908ff5f4fe3c93e4b25907624ae10e6d.mp3",
      "duration": 2.844
    },
    {
      "actor": "gate_guard",
      "text": "黄旗到了，花石纲先过。其余人等，留在关外！",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#tickChapter"
      ],
      "hash": "7507db0d4eed0ca92a1f4738ffe6a29f98752e42e7831984d6dc2e55d366dec3",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/7507db0d4eed0ca92a1f4738ffe6a29f98752e42e7831984d6dc2e55d366dec3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.428
    },
    {
      "actor": "fu",
      "text": "名册上的人和物，一样不能少。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#tickChapter"
      ],
      "hash": "a83b6531a2a9c959caa3681f64f0f15c4b509ce6961c2b001e4a80be85afb835",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/a83b6531a2a9c959caa3681f64f0f15c4b509ce6961c2b001e4a80be85afb835.mp3",
      "duration": 2.916
    },
    {
      "actor": "fu",
      "text": "应奉局的名册，自有应奉局定。花石、雀鸟、乐工，都得按时送到。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#fu_manifest"
      ],
      "hash": "2c5deb388142a6d996721aabbd1f5b5cfab988094be198911c9610b948cbbec1",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/2c5deb388142a6d996721aabbd1f5b5cfab988094be198911c9610b948cbbec1.mp3",
      "duration": 7.272
    },
    {
      "actor": "beggar",
      "text": "靠墙那块草席还干着。先睡稳了，天亮再找门路。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#nest_welcome"
      ],
      "hash": "809ce7e68e528c462c84bd199645d315e348297ac56968d30b90aa8c0d7bac84",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/809ce7e68e528c462c84bd199645d315e348297ac56968d30b90aa8c0d7bac84.mp3",
      "duration": 5.436
    },
    {
      "actor": "gate_guard",
      "text": "应奉局的花石纲要过关。路引对姓名，认得本人的更不能冒名。没凭据，随役夫队过关，或请人作保。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#gate_rules"
      ],
      "hash": "9e4b9cf0865d2c3d05c695c72311c716c55aa5a17727e41aef828f30d68cdf24",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/9e4b9cf0865d2c3d05c695c72311c716c55aa5a17727e41aef828f30d68cdf24.mp3",
      "duration": 10.476
    },
    {
      "actor": "gate_relief",
      "text": "应奉局的花石纲要过关。路引对姓名，认得本人的更不能冒名。没凭据，随役夫队过关，或请人作保。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#gate_rules"
      ],
      "hash": "1f6013ceaa4b69dc09250f8b6c15a5ea82d2ac829c69372609e41b3dfe087aa2",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/1f6013ceaa4b69dc09250f8b6c15a5ea82d2ac829c69372609e41b3dfe087aa2.mp3",
      "duration": 10.404
    },
    {
      "actor": "gate_merchant",
      "text": "赵成，东溪人。韩校尉认得我，只是这一回连熟人也查。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#merchant_name"
      ],
      "hash": "ff11a0b69d4372e8554c46851c89b85290e1530dfb1973af68b668d11381d9af",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/ff11a0b69d4372e8554c46851c89b85290e1530dfb1973af68b668d11381d9af.mp3",
      "duration": 6.084
    },
    {
      "actor": "relay",
      "text": "陈小乙。领里还缝着呢，原来给驿站跑腿的。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#runner_name"
      ],
      "hash": "dc78e6f327a7591a581f4e5b2286d8cfa2f9af90fa52f047190209d96bef50a5",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/dc78e6f327a7591a581f4e5b2286d8cfa2f9af90fa52f047190209d96bef50a5.mp3",
      "duration": 5.832
    },
    {
      "actor": "tea_host",
      "text": "两文差费总算交清了。劳你替我们挡这一回，青禾的去留，我们还得自己想明白。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#help_mother"
      ],
      "hash": "a5321472b0a464b1904e5160655ad72730c6bfabc834d058a0979cd125cb06b5",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/a5321472b0a464b1904e5160655ad72730c6bfabc834d058a0979cd125cb06b5.mp3",
      "duration": 8.46
    },
    {
      "actor": "qinghe",
      "text": "我娘怕我走，可我想进京，看看那些曲子究竟在哪里唱。别替我答应，也别替我拒绝。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#qinghe_wish"
      ],
      "hash": "057387c3711478a7bb8d287c578581ee3429348c5e3d7748ff9053c0a09fba94",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/057387c3711478a7bb8d287c578581ee3429348c5e3d7748ff9053c0a09fba94.mp3",
      "duration": 11.268
    },
    {
      "actor": "scribe",
      "text": "眼睛倒尖。无相门不替人担罪。你认得针囊，我可以教你改扮；柜里迷毒散，五文。药能混进茶食，谁吃下谁遭殃，别连累无辜。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#scribe_secret"
      ],
      "hash": "50f0812c062acf2baeedd59704a6d7ddf14684b2cb23512e7a83cb9462eb6588",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/50f0812c062acf2baeedd59704a6d7ddf14684b2cb23512e7a83cb9462eb6588.mp3",
      "duration": 13.392
    },
    {
      "actor": "scribe",
      "text": "这一包给你。要用在哪里，你自己担着。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#poison_buy"
      ],
      "hash": "d2da67cf42a0052fc758830ac71909babcbbf4392f4f71c509b5e87a620609b4",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/d2da67cf42a0052fc758830ac71909babcbbf4392f4f71c509b5e87a620609b4.mp3",
      "duration": 4.14
    },
    {
      "actor": "qinghe",
      "text": "上头有我的名字。原来他们早写好了……我得自己想明白。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#list_show"
      ],
      "hash": "cba93e244aa09bd7de4209135ff17e98d60ee68e5b2e55a5156c8f73b6268b67",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/cba93e244aa09bd7de4209135ff17e98d60ee68e5b2e55a5156c8f73b6268b67.mp3",
      "duration": 7.884
    },
    {
      "actor": "qinghe",
      "text": "你愿意替我去，我答应。但不是卖给谁。我教你我的口音，到了京城，替我看看那座园子。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#qinghe_consent"
      ],
      "hash": "c6e870e218f41b5aef562db3dda9c0b2c3e145d17592c46ade8e2061864d9377",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/c6e870e218f41b5aef562db3dda9c0b2c3e145d17592c46ade8e2061864d9377.mp3",
      "duration": 11.448
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "方才你替那母女说话，我看见了。随我进关；这份担保，来日要你还在人情上。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#royal_vouch"
      ],
      "hash": "d1886879fd3db7b830898acac0f7dd120f1f3222c63dc4020d3750c27579d060",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/d1886879fd3db7b830898acac0f7dd120f1f3222c63dc4020d3750c27579d060.mp3",
      "duration": 7.74
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "你竟真进来了。说说，是哪条门路？",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#entry_story"
      ],
      "hash": "2ac703b100502b5eabecf09b262406871d07f26488cd5b845124110bd6ff5d2e",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/2ac703b100502b5eabecf09b262406871d07f26488cd5b845124110bd6ff5d2e.mp3",
      "duration": 3.816
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "借过我的名字，今后就拿自己的作为来还。我想在临溪留下一个看得见实情的人。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#entry_truth"
      ],
      "hash": "c4e51c4c5baadae8d485cc07759fe9e94b2822b38f68922319798b94c99184eb",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/c4e51c4c5baadae8d485cc07759fe9e94b2822b38f68922319798b94c99184eb.mp3",
      "duration": 6.984
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "我不缺唯命是从的人。你去追这本副账，原账交我或顾钦差都可。若愿当差，拿这枚玉符给顾钦差看；若有别的门路，也不必勉强。做到，我替你留一个赴艮岳的名额。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#royal_task"
      ],
      "hash": "ac9923a99dfb8fbb0539d656eca00935e880229891e78b591f1a3a1548ff8add",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/ac9923a99dfb8fbb0539d656eca00935e880229891e78b591f1a3a1548ff8add.mp3",
      "duration": 15.264
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "好。凭据保得住一时，做过的事保不保得住？",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#entry_lie"
      ],
      "hash": "f258a3f5e558102483a67155e4e95eb35b30487f4e2a3a558ce9ecc5695abb93",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/f258a3f5e558102483a67155e4e95eb35b30487f4e2a3a558ce9ecc5695abb93.mp3",
      "duration": 4.392
    },
    {
      "actor": "traveler",
      "text": "我在关外坐着，没白坐。这话留着骗别人。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#entry_lie"
      ],
      "hash": "f900abfdb711394e1f67d0398360306a0d0310c9c39dddafba3836a0b0ca35e9",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/f900abfdb711394e1f67d0398360306a0d0310c9c39dddafba3836a0b0ca35e9.mp3",
      "duration": 4.032
    },
    {
      "actor": "prisoner",
      "text": "账面两套数，亏空写进花石纲。副账在我身上，没有它，连我也活不到今日。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#ledger_story"
      ],
      "hash": "780808e07230d1f681711538cb91773c6750201243bde025c7ce165e3fd2807e",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/780808e07230d1f681711538cb91773c6750201243bde025c7ce165e3fd2807e.mp3",
      "duration": 8.352
    },
    {
      "actor": "prisoner",
      "text": "我盼锦衣客或顾钦差替我查清。青竹会惦记役钱，赤砂帮惦记工钱；符祥最不想它落在外人手里。账给你，交谁由你定。别把我的口供当成账里的铁证。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#ledger_get"
      ],
      "hash": "200f4e8023c0b7472cc64cbb4abf1a126503afd7164e8bb547b2874116f076b7",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/200f4e8023c0b7472cc64cbb4abf1a126503afd7164e8bb547b2874116f076b7.mp3",
      "duration": 16.956
    },
    {
      "actor": "shen",
      "text": "……我把桥让开。她愿不愿，是她的事。戒指的账，我自己还。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#shen_space"
      ],
      "hash": "0170942c5969722cfc8da458cb7b5ed570843fcda4d2a7b58d3c16a56a1c3c3a",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/0170942c5969722cfc8da458cb7b5ed570843fcda4d2a7b58d3c16a56a1c3c3a.mp3",
      "duration": 7.668
    },
    {
      "actor": "su",
      "text": "我想唱自己的曲子。若有一天去京城，也是我自己走去。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#su_wish"
      ],
      "hash": "98953b9e3e03ffcf0f879f7c594f7eb8ec28c4a5e74f3a0dde32c191468bc76f",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/98953b9e3e03ffcf0f879f7c594f7eb8ec28c4a5e74f3a0dde32c191468bc76f.mp3",
      "duration": 7.668
    },
    {
      "actor": "qing",
      "text": "花石能进京，脚夫的工钱却不能少。这批名册在符祥的鸟笼底下。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#convoy_dispute"
