      "duration": 6.444
    },
    {
      "actor": "chi",
      "text": "工钱先垫上，收据两边各留一份。花石送进京，也得有人记得抬石头的人。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#convoy_peace"
      ],
      "hash": "591e6dd61c0560298c2ec122677bdc1e20638867528713dd8392beadbd3935b1",
