      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/591e6dd61c0560298c2ec122677bdc1e20638867528713dd8392beadbd3935b1.mp3",
      "duration": 6.264
    },
    {
      "actor": "thief",
      "text": "是我。偷来的钱袋还没花。你要送我见官，还是让我把东西还回去？",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#yan_secret"
      ],
      "hash": "2337c6223ef4045f128e4b3b10ac92fcb1fcb3bc0ea2e3c0cd882a08c5de570d",
      "status": "generated",
      "url": "/assets/audio/npc/2337c6223ef4045f128e4b3b10ac92fcb1fcb3bc0ea2e3c0cd882a08c5de570d.mp3",
      "duration": 6.948
    },
    {
      "actor": "thief",
      "text": "这回算欠你的。袖口的活我能教；至于赤砂堂，我替你递个话。",
      "sources": [
        "src/chapter.js#yan_release"
      ],
      "hash": "00b4c1b41f12402647c927eedcdf0398187076ddb49eced3c02aae4a5b1affd1",
